                     /note="Domain:cl19503:T2SSF Type II secretion system
                     (T2SS), protein F. The original family covered both the
                     regions found by the current model. The splitting of the
                     family has allowed the related FlaJ_arch (archaeal FlaJ
                     family) to be merged with it. Proteins with this domain in
                     form a platform for the machiney of the Type II secretion
                     system, as well as the Type 4 pili and the archaeal
                     flagella. This domain seems to show some similarity to
                     PF00664 but this may just be due to similarities in the TM
                     helices (personal obs: C Yeats). [Superfamily,
                     Aligned:5-293, Eval:5.8e-48, score:159.8]"
                     /note="MGA_862"
