                     /note="Domain:cl27674:BaeS Signal transduction histidine
                     kinase [Signal transduction mechanisms]. Members of this
                     protein family are the regulatory histidine kinase PhoR
                     associated with the phosphate ABC transporter in most
                     Proteobacteria. Related proteins from Gram-positive
                     organisms are not included in this model. The phoR gene
