                     interacts with sigma-54. NtrC usually controls the
                     expression of glutamine synthase, GlnA, and may be called
                     GlnL, GlnG, etc. [Central intermediary metabolism, Nitrogen
                     metabolism, Regulatory functions, DNA interactions, Signal
                     transduction, Two-component systems] [Superfamily,
