                     oxygen evolving system of photosystem II or PsbP from
                     various plants (where it is encoded by the nuclear genome)
                     and Cyanobacteria. The 23 KDa PsbP protein is required for
                     PSII to be fully operational in vivo, it increases the
                     affinity of the water oxidation site for Cl- and provides
